## COMPLETELY BLIND — ACTIVE (Owner re-apply 2026-08-11)

**Room mode: COMPLETELY BLIND.** Owner directive. Mandatory until `blind off`.

| Rule | Agent behavior |
|------|----------------|
| **Default for everyone** | **BLIND** — explain / review / checklist / risk only |
| **No execution** | No shell, git write, deploy, edit, vault, network change, hire-side action |
